# Every attack of the program tests/programs/attack.asm, and what the kernel
# makes of it (on Bochs: docs/emulators.md lists where a 286 differs).
program: attack
# DOSBox-X stops itself at the jump to the TSS (docs/emulators.md).
emulators: bochs mame
timeout: 60
---
rx286, test build
attack: cli
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{attacks.cli}
attack: sti
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{attacks.sti}
