rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{attacks.iopl_f}
attack: lock
@bochs attack: lock ran without a fault (not a 286)
@mame rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{attacks.lock}
attack: loadall
@bochs rx286: program fault #UD at 0007:{attacks.loadall}
@mame rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{attacks.loadall}
attack: 287 error
@bochs rx286: the 287 reported an error (IRQ13)
@mame attack: no 287 error arrived (no 287 emulated?)
